Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.58,0:00:08.25,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,The rain and wind won’t bother me in my warm apartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.67,0:00:13.45,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,And they gave me such a soft futon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.63,0:00:18.91,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,There’s confetti in the bottle.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.91,0:00:22.89,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I feel so content!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.89,0:00:25.42,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Don’t feel so content with just one or two of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.89,0:00:29.27,KM,Iorygoi,0000,0000,0000,,At this rate, it’ll take you a hundred years to fill the bottle.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.27,0:00:31.90,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,That’s okay, Ioryogi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.90,0:00:35.11,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Even if it takes a hundred years, I’ll still try my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.14,0:00:39.71,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Do you think I want to be around you for a hundred years?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.05,0:02:17.75,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Do you understand what you’re supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.75,0:02:22.76,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes! Heal people’s broken hearts so I can get more confetti.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.75,0:02:28.59,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,The birds are singing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.76,0:02:33.98,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,The flowers are sparkling from the morning dew.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.40,0:02:37.36,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,They smell nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.92,0:02:44.39,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Waking up earlier than normal really lets you experience all sorts of new things.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.39,0:02:46.54,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Can’t you be a little less peppy when just walking? {Keeper: orig line “Can’t you settle down your happy walk feelings?“}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.80,0:02:48.86,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It’s not like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.86,0:02:49.30,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.30,0:02:53.30,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,This is such a wonderful little lane!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.16,0:03:16.06,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,What a beautiful person.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.81,0:03:35.75,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,E-Excuse me…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.51,0:03:46.30,KM,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,You saw that, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.30,0:03:50.05,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Why were you crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.16,0:03:56.71,KM,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder why.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.77,0:04:04.64,KM,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,Because the green leaves are pretty… maybe? {Keeper: orig line “The green leaves are pretty… perhaps?“}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.86,0:04:09.14,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,The green leaves are so pretty that you cried?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.65,0:04:12.43,KM,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,I don’t quite understand it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.43,0:04:14.46,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I’m sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.46,0:04:17.15,KM,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,By the way, may I ask your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.62,0:04:20.15,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I’m Hanato Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.29,0:04:22.65,KM,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,I’m Kohaku!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.11,0:04:24.21,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Kohaku?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.12,0:04:28.36,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi-san, stuffed animals shouldn’t talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.36,0:04:30.94,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Kohaku, as in, Kohaku from the heavens?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.94,0:04:32.14,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Heavens?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.08,0:04:34.31,KM,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.93,0:04:38.19,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,No wonder you smelled different than normal humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.64,0:04:40.07,KM,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,And who is this, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.07,0:04:41.71,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.71,0:04:43.68,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,It’s okay in front of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.68,0:04:45.44,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.44,0:04:49.01,KM,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi-san… I’ve heard that name somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.95,0:05:01.29,KM,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,I’ve forgotten.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.80,0:05:06.75,KM,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,Listen, it’s not Ioryogi! It just sounds like it! {Keeper: orig line “Ioryogi; Not Iryogi! A name that sounds like it!“}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.20,0:05:08.63,KM,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,A name that sounds like it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.02,0:05:13.83,KM,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,Could you be Iorogi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.89,0:05:16.72,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, that’s right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.76,0:05:19.98,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,You two know each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.45,0:05:23.24,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Just by name.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.24,0:05:27.74,KM,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,To think that Iorogi-san looked so cute…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.74,0:05:33.96,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Well, this form is just temporary while I’m Ioryogi. {Keeper: orig line “No! This form is just for the time being as Ioryogi.“}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.96,0:05:36.62,KM,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,Got it. Ioryogi-san it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.25,0:05:39.18,KM,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,And you’re Kobato-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.18,0:05:40.27,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.23,0:05:45.60,KM,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,I need to water the trees in the\Ngarden before it gets too sunny.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.11,0:05:47.42,KM,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.42,0:05:48.67,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.18,0:06:08.84,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.84,0:06:12.10,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Ah! You scared me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.10,0:06:14.10,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I was looking at the leaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.04,0:06:20.50,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But no matter how long I look at them, I don’t start crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.50,0:06:21.44,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder why.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.44,0:06:25.56,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Who knows. When I look at them, I do cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.56,0:06:29.04,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Eh, really? Please tell me why!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.04,0:06:31.26,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Because the person helping me is lazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.26,0:06:35.81,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Just thinking about how cleaning up these leaves will eat up the whole day makes me weep.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.34,0:06:39.84,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I’ll do it! I’ll show you how quickly I can finish!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.26,0:06:45.56,KM,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,What a birdbrain. I’ll help you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.56,0:06:47.03,KM,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.03,0:06:48.55,KM,Boy,0000,0000,0000,,Let me help too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.55,0:06:50.40,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.81,0:07:00.74,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.74,0:07:03.96,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I want to know why Kohaku-san was crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.96,0:07:06.78,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,If it’s because she’s been hurt, I want to heal her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.25,0:07:10.51,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,I don’t think you’ll get it just from reading that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.95,0:07:14.78,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But it might give me some kind of hint.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.70,0:07:18.60,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I don’t get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.60,0:07:19.45,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You don’t say…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.91,0:07:24.56,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Tomorrow, I will wake up early and try asking Kohaku-san one more time!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.07,0:07:34.90,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I overslept!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.90,0:07:36.45,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,I knew this would happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.00,0:07:41.69,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,She’s not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.51,0:07:43.85,KM,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.75,0:07:51.76,KM,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you for your hard work.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.20,0:07:57.03,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It’s Kohaku-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.18,0:07:59.43,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.05,0:08:02.49,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.49,0:08:04.39,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Don’t be rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.39,0:08:05.73,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Rude?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.73,0:08:09.31,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,If you go over there, you’ll be in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.53,0:08:13.40,KM,Shuichiro,0000,0000,0000,,You didn’t have to come all the way here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.40,0:08:15.32,KM,Shuichiro,0000,0000,0000,,You could’ve waited at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.60,0:08:20.05,KM,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,It’s just that… walking home with you makes me happy. {Keeper: orig line “But this way, it makes me happy to go home with you.“}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.05,0:08:24.08,KM,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,Also, I wanted to be with you a little bit longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.86,0:08:31.28,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,They’re flirting like crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.79,0:08:36.89,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,What a wonderful mansion.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.89,0:08:38.97,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Something you’ll never have.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.97,0:08:40.89,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You weren’t even invited.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.89,0:08:45.73,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I know, but even if you’re rich, you can still have problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.73,0:08:48.21,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Where did you learn something like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.21,0:08:51.24,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,In the magazine I was reading at that convenience store.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.25,0:08:57.24,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(593,0)\bord0\shad0\b1\frz3.036\frx4\fry356\fscx55\fscy80\pos(954,405)\c&H1D3B29&}Kudo
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.64,0:08:56.12,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.12,0:08:57.24,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.60,0:09:00.70,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,When will it be okay for me to call out to them?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.70,0:09:02.91,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,No, that’s not the problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.91,0:09:04.77,KM,Shuichiro,0000,0000,0000,,I’m sorry, I couldn’t keep my promise today.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.58,0:09:09.59,KM,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,You are open the entire night, Shuichiro-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.86,0:09:13.50,KM,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,And the patients are very important.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.60,0:09:16.01,KM,Shuichiro,0000,0000,0000,,You are both important.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.05,0:09:25.04,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You {\i1}really{\i0} weren’t invited. Let’s go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.79,0:09:29.23,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,H-Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.66,0:09:37.65,KM,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,Spirit of the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.21,0:09:39.90,KM,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,Please, answer my call.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.24,0:09:43.64,KM,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,Lend your powers to water the trees.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.87,0:09:46.16,KM,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,Gather yourself to save these lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.21,0:09:57.80,KM,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,Fill the sky, oh blessed rain!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.32,0:10:04.80,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,So pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.75,0:10:18.93,KM,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.93,0:10:20.45,KM,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.95,0:10:24.04,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Watch what you’re watering!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.04,0:10:25.91,KM,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,I’m sorry. I’m so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.75,0:10:30.63,KM,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,I’m really sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.63,0:10:34.82,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,No, I’m sorry too. I apologize for coming here uninvited.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.52,0:10:37.31,KM,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.72,0:10:39.15,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Actually…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.77,0:10:46.26,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yesterday, I happened to see you with a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.95,0:10:48.02,KM,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.02,0:10:51.10,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I’m sorry, but I followed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.65,0:10:57.77,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But… I still don’t understand why you cried.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.51,0:11:02.85,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It’s been bothering me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.60,0:11:11.04,KM,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,I don’t understand it well myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.04,0:11:17.69,KM,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,But when I see something pretty, I want to show it to Shuichiro-san as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.92,0:11:20.16,KM,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,It reminds me of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.16,0:11:21.30,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.35,0:11:25.24,KM,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,When I think about Shuichiro-san… {Keeper: Err… he aint dead is he?; orig line “When I remember Shuichiro-san…“}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.39,0:11:28.14,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Think about him? {Keeper: orig line “When you remember?“}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.33,0:11:32.93,KM,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,I feel a sudden ache in my chest.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.16,0:11:35.94,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,An ache?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.41,0:11:39.36,KM,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,You could say it feels fuzzy. {Might wanna see a doctor -Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.50,0:11:45.04,KM,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,When I’m with Shuichiro-san, I always feel so content.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.04,0:11:49.29,KM,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,And when he sometimes shows me his bashful smile…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.29,0:11:54.30,KM,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,…the memories just overflow me with emotions.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.30,0:11:55.21,KM,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,Like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.80,0:11:56.90,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.30,0:11:58.21,KM,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,Like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.74,0:12:00.90,KM,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,And the tears just start flowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.90,0:12:04.11,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Ah… I still don’t understand. {She doesn’t understand much. -Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.11,0:12:07.89,KM,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,I’m sorry, I just can’t explain it very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.89,0:12:12.87,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,For crying out loud, you shed tears because you’re so in love that it hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.82,0:12:17.23,KM,Kohaku and Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Love?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.30,0:12:20.61,KM,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,I see, love.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.61,0:12:22.98,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I get it. It’s love.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.98,0:12:24.76,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You look like you don’t.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.76,0:12:28.48,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,In love, troubles are an unavoidable aspect. I read it in a magazine. {last thing she needs is to be reading magazines -.- -Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.48,0:12:31.96,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Kohaku-san, is anything troubling you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.70,0:12:35.91,KM,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,Let’s see…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.91,0:12:36.31,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.26,0:12:42.06,KM,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,You could say the way Shuichiro-san is always busy troubles me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.06,0:12:45.38,KM,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,We haven’t even done one of those “dates.”
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.31,0:12:47.49,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Date?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.49,0:12:52.76,KM,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,Going with the person you love to someplace like an amusement park.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.76,0:12:54.48,KM,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,It’s something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.70,0:12:59.31,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,An amusement park… date.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.31,0:13:01.67,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Leave it up to me, Kohaku-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.90,0:13:04.08,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I’ll do my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.23,0:13:24.00,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,If she can go on an amusement park date with Shuichiro-san, Kohaku-san’s heart will heal.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.00,0:13:27.21,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,First, I have to learn about amusement parks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.70,0:13:31.97,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,This is an amusement park?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.40,0:13:34.77,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It looks like fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.77,0:13:35.50,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.50,0:13:38.39,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Tickets are 3000 yen?! {Keeper: lol, Danish amusement park tickets are like 4-9000 yen}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.34,0:13:42.94,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I guess you need money for amusement parks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.21,0:13:47.94,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But I don’t have any money. What should I do? {sell yourself}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.94,0:13:49.50,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Don’t ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.50,0:13:53.28,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, trying to heal Kohaku is…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.28,0:13:55.02,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Ah! Ioryogi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.02,0:13:56.83,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.83,0:13:58.52,KM,Shop worker,0000,0000,0000,,First place, a trip to Hawaii!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.52,0:14:00.42,KM,Shop worker,0000,0000,0000,,Second place, a trip to the hot springs!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.42,0:14:02.69,KM,Shop worker,0000,0000,0000,,Third place, tickets to the amusement park!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.19,0:14:07.34,KM,Shop worker,0000,0000,0000,,Spin it around and get a ball with the right color to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.34,0:14:10.37,KM,Shop worker,0000,0000,0000,,We’re inviting pairs to try.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.37,0:14:13.34,KM,Shop worker,0000,0000,0000,,Now, use your fortune tickets please! Your fortune tickets.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.34,0:14:18.85,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Amazing! We can win amusement park tickets over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.85,0:14:20.34,KM,Shop worker,0000,0000,0000,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.94,0:14:25.00,KM,Shop worker,0000,0000,0000,,Miss, where’s your fortune ticket?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.00,0:14:25.86,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.86,0:14:28.79,KM,Shop worker,0000,0000,0000,,If you don’t have a ticket, you can’t participate.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.97,0:14:35.28,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Before I can get the amusement park ticket, I have to have a fortune ticket?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.73,0:14:41.29,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Fortune ticket…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.71,0:14:46.28,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,It’s also natural to feel dejected no matter what you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.28,0:14:48.30,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,And anyway, Kohaku…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.30,0:14:49.80,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,A fortune ticket…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.80,0:14:52.23,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Nobody’s dropped one?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.23,0:14:54.80,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,What?! You mean you haven’t given up yet?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.80,0:14:58.80,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Geez, you look pretty chipper for someone who’s dejected…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.13,0:15:07.19,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It’s a fortune ticket!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.13,0:15:20.54,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It’s a fortune ticket. Let me spin it please!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.54,0:15:21.60,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.60,0:15:23.21,KM,Shop Keeper,0000,0000,0000,,G-Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.96,0:15:26.21,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I’m going to try my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.70,0:15:29.88,KT,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Amusement park tickets.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.82,0:15:35.85,KM,Shop Keeper,0000,0000,0000,,Congratulations! You won!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.17,0:15:38.14,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Eh! I did?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.49,0:15:39.68,KT,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You’ve got to be kidding me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.68,0:15:40.66,KM,Shop keeper,0000,0000,0000,,Fifth place!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.66,0:15:44.69,KM,Shop keeper,0000,0000,0000,,A stuffed alligator animal. Give it lots of love!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.62,0:15:48.75,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Winning something like this is just a bother.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.75,0:15:50.44,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Why didn’t you refuse it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.44,0:15:56.53,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,He was so kind when he gave it to me. Refusing it would have been rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.14,0:16:04.96,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.67,0:16:09.94,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,If it’s not the amusement park tickets, then it’s no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.69,0:16:15.43,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I-I’m sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.90,0:16:17.38,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.38,0:16:20.44,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,You! Stop daydreaming! {Keeper: So fujiomoto doesn’t like beautiful women?! orig line “You! Stop being so dreamy.“}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.10,0:16:28.78,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Are you delivering these newspapers?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.78,0:16:29.99,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.99,0:16:34.30,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But I heard from Sayaka-sensei that your part-time job is delivering pizzas.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.52,0:16:36.82,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,I do that as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.20,0:16:39.17,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,You’re that busy?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.65,0:16:41.80,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,What’s that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.80,0:16:44.35,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,An alligator I won in a lottery.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.07,0:16:52.25,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But the alligator is no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.44,0:16:58.43,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Amusement park tickets.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.90,0:17:01.42,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. I got them from my part-time job.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.22,0:17:08.14,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.45,0:17:16.95,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.24,0:17:19.99,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Can you please give these tickets to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.99,0:17:21.91,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me? Don’t be ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.97,0:17:28.60,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Ah! What if I trade the alligator for the tickets?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.18,0:17:31.68,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,No good. I don’t need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.68,0:17:33.48,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.68,0:17:36.46,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It’s so Kohaku-san can have a date at the amusement park!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.45,0:17:52.77,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.29,0:17:56.36,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,With these, you can have a date with Shuichiro-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.92,0:18:00.03,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Just do what you want, why don’t you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.03,0:18:01.94,KM,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,Those newspapers…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.47,0:18:06.60,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,To get these, I have to help deliver them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.63,0:18:12.08,KM,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,To get these tickets, you have to deliver newspapers?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.08,0:18:14.34,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes! Please, take them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.93,0:18:16.55,KM,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.20,0:18:19.59,KM,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,But I can’t accept them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.71,0:18:22.52,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Why is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.52,0:18:26.60,KM,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,Shuichiro-san is busy, so those tickets are useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.97,0:18:32.86,KM,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,But on the other hand, those tickets shouldn’t go to waste…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.30,0:18:35.77,KM,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,That’s it! Kobato-san, you should go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.63,0:18:38.52,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,M-Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.52,0:18:40.92,KM,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, with Ioryogi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.92,0:18:42.03,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.08,0:18:45.16,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, with Ioryogi-san…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.83,0:18:50.38,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Stop imagining that! {XD}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.71,0:18:56.84,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I can’t do that! If you can’t go with Shuichiro-san, then there’s no point.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.87,0:19:01.92,KM,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,But I really think it’s impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.06,0:19:04.33,KM,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,And…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.36,0:19:07.82,KM,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,I really can’t be self-centered.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.83,0:19:10.43,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,That’s…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.55,0:19:14.17,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,…selfish, isn’t it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.07,0:19:20.25,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,To me, it looked like Shuichiro-san really enjoys the time he spends with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.25,0:19:24.16,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I saw how happy you looked when you were with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.16,0:19:34.67,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Shuichiro-san must think the world of you, just like you think the world of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.67,0:19:40.22,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I’m sure he wants to have a date as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.22,0:19:41.60,KM,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-san…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.92,0:19:44.56,KM,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,Shuichiro-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.99,0:19:50.93,KM,Shuichiro,0000,0000,0000,,Can we really have those tickets?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.20,0:19:54.88,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.33,0:19:57.09,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Here, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.98,0:20:03.36,KM,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,Shuichiro-san, can we really go together?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.64,0:20:06.57,KM,Shuichiro,0000,0000,0000,,I don’t hate the ferris wheel.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.40,0:20:40.07,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I can’t see them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.07,0:20:42.44,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Of course not! Let’s go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.44,0:20:43.79,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Okay…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.33,0:20:53.19,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I’m sure they’re having a lot of fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.19,0:20:54.04,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Who knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.73,0:21:04.79,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Ushagi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.68,0:21:07.50,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,A messenger from the heavens.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.50,0:21:10.39,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,The heavens? Another acquaintance?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.26,0:21:16.81,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,A time limit?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.08,0:21:19.56,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Until when?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.70,0:21:26.19,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,The bottle has to be full when the four seasons have passed?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.19,0:21:27.40,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.47,0:21:40.03,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You heard, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.03,0:21:42.75,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes. There’s a time limit now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.31,0:21:46.19,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,When the four seasons have passed, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.19,0:21:49.68,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,In other words, you have one year to fill the bottle.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.12,0:21:52.01,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,If you can’t do it…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.68,0:21:55.23,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,…I cannot go to the place I want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.23,0:21:57.10,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Look, nothing’s been added.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.36,0:22:00.17,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,They’re not shaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.17,0:22:02.02,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Do you know why?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.97,0:22:04.99,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,No, I don’t.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.99,0:22:08.47,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder if it’s because I haven’t healed Kohaku-san’s heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.47,0:22:14.37,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,It’s because those who are already happy don’t need healing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.37,0:22:17.03,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,So she wasn’t hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.03,0:22:18.85,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,And you’re happy about this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.09,0:22:22.58,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,A hundred points!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.58,0:22:25.03,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Eh?! A hundred points?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.57,0:22:26.90,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Minus!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.90,0:22:30.26,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Minus… hundred points?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.26,0:22:34.87,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You picked the wrong person. Not realizing that fact costs you points.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.87,0:22:38.93,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But the fact that she’s happy makes me happy anyway!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.93,0:22:43.09,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Don’t be so carefree! You have just one year and you have to work relentlessly!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.49,0:22:46.76,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes! I’ll do my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.00,0:22:49.95,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Again with such a frivolous face.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.95,0:22:51.45,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It is not!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.45,0:22:53.30,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Didn’t I say you have to work relentlessly?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.30,0:22:55.23,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,What does a relentless face look like? {Keeper: orig line “what kind of a face is relentless?“}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.23,0:22:57.20,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Like this! Can you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,Next,0000,0000,0000,,The Fireflies’ Promise
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,
